                "Welcome to Day 18. In modern corporate strategy, brand equity cannot be built solely through paid advertising. While advertising purchases audience attention, consumers maintain high cognitive skepticism toward paid corporate messages. Strategic Public Relations (PR) is the deliberate, planned, and sustained discipline of establishing and maintaining mutual understanding between an organization and its diverse stakeholder publics—including journalists, investors, regulators, employees, and local communities.",
